40	//! `invalid capture group name <NAME>` (NAME decoded, invalid escapes/lone surrogates shown
41	//! as U+FFFD; raw lone surrogate in the name: `invalid capture group name` without <>),
42	//! `invalid escape in capture group name`, `invalid named back reference <NAME>`,
43	//! `expected '<' in named back reference`, `duplicate group name NAME` (when several names
