95	//! * Unicode data (properties, case folding) is Unicode 17.0 via `crate::unicode`.
96	//!
97	//! # JS-facing behaviour of the original (for the RegExp object layer)
98	//!
99	//! * `source`/`flags`/`toString`: see [`escape_source`]; `toString()` = "/" + source + "/" +
100	//!   flags; `String(RegExp.prototype)` = "/(?:)/", `RegExp.prototype.source` = "(?:)",
